---
name: Sysmon Fluent Bit winevtlog → OCSF
description: |
  Collect named Sysmon event data with Fluent Bit's `winevtlog` input and
  normalize it to OCSF. Run this pipeline on Windows with permission to read
  the Sysmon channel.
---

from_fluent_bit "winevtlog", options={
  channels: "Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational",
  event_data_as_map: true,
  event_template_cache_size: 256,
  string_inserts: false,
}
sysmon::ocsf::normalize
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
